  "releaseNotes": "Added\n- IDisposable support in Parameter classes.\n- Asynchronous refresh and write support (RefreshAsync, SetValueAsync).\n- Unit test project.\n\nFixed\n- Unsafe client locking in parameter writes.\n- File name mismatches and duplicated doc comments in some parameter classes.\n- Host-endianness-dependent conversion in Single parameter classes.\n- Missing disposed check in SetValue/SetValueAsync in parameter classes.\n- DistinctUntilChanged in memory area classes comparing List instances by reference instead of by content, so it never suppressed duplicate refreshes.",
